					<Version number="3.0.17.1" postdate="2012-09-13T14:27:46.3683495Z" signature="ga3iAJLSHkZzsl6WwwY9ezdbPR1XqtroQbt3PhTkotrwt318MD04Rnp/ofhUXsNluKmixy1lh8O9XcA0vVgVsqHAb7wbnTv13P//hydLsV98uHs7P7fI7YVze7wouOwz6ZEkLa2nivZjb5FwQmmJxegioqkv/gF1AlIdaSmYKa0=" fileSize="48709253">
						<Targets>
							<Target number="0.0.0.0" includeAllGreater="false" />
						</Targets>
						<Summary>Fixed bugs:&#xD;
- The wrong roomtemperature was used when calulating cooling for Modul Klimadecke.&#xD;
- Connecting one system to another system instead a distributor, sometimes caused random errors.</Summary>
						<CustomData></CustomData>
					</Version>
					<Version number="3.0.16.3" postdate="2012-07-13T14:17:11.7700337Z" signature="aPkXDy/L0X84cHvaj24TL6FTuXfGFXxu6A4+RFcxH0EPeQI8vdcdN5kmTaSQW4SlWWYpTCwOCht7hxthrr2NBsfnYTjEw2ti60hU7BBIwFtf5GOuYX+1wS1fFpjEQTr8sLpdvW2J1wENada174d5bp5WbG+U8O1f2miiDTp0hoQ=" fileSize="48705968">
						<Targets>
							<Target number="0.0.0.0" includeAllGreater="false" />
						</Targets>
						<Summary>New features in this version:&#xD;
- The size of the generated image can be choosen when importing PDFs&#xD;
- When planning a Modul Klimaboden system graphically a recommentation for the required number of module strips is calculated&#xD;
- Textboxes that show parameters of Euroval and Ecotherm systems can be rotated in 90° steps and the background of these textboxes can be set to be solid&#xD;
- The text displayed for the pipe length in these textboxes has been changed to the format "Total Length (Supply Pipe + Return Pipe)"&#xD;
- Autosaving of the project every 10 minutes can be enabled under "Options"-&gt;"Settings"&#xD;
- Display of the imported plan can be disabled when layouting systems or connection pipes&#xD;
- The width of wooden support and c-profiles can be changed when layouting Modul Klimadecken systems&#xD;
- Covering can be moved independently of wodden support or c-profiles when layouting Modul Klimadecken systems&#xD;
&#xD;
The following bugs were fixed:&#xD;
- Systemparameters have not been saved correctly within projects&#xD;
- the maximum number of modules has not been respected when planning Modul Klimaboden systems&#xD;
- A bug that occured when planning 3m-registers in Hitherm systems&#xD;
- Connection pipes could not be planned for Hitherm Compact systems&#xD;
- Unheated areas have not been substracted from the lving zone in Euroval and Ecotherm systems</Summary>
						<CustomData></CustomData>
					</Version>
